<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Ivory coffee campaign begins Nov 14, price slashed.</title>
<headline>Ivory coffee campaign begins Nov 14, price slashed.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast's 1996/97 coffee marketing campaign opens on November 14 with the farm-gate guide price slashed to 500 CFA francs per kilo of green bagged coffee, Agriculture Minister Lambert Kouassi Konan said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The previous recommended price was 700 CFA francs. Both prices include five CFA for the sack.</p>
</text>
